<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Office resumed.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Office resumed.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it resumed coverage of U.S. Office Products Co with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- U.S. Office closed Friday at 33-1/8.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>	  (( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
